To run GlimmerM you should use the following command:

  glimmerm_<system> <fasta_file_with the DNA_sequence_to_be analyzed> orfs
or
  glimmerm_<system> <fasta_file_with the DNA_sequence_to_be analyzed> orfs -d directory_of_the_training_files
 

where <system> is linux, alpha or sun.

if the -d option is not specified the system will suppose that the training files are in the current directory.

The training files are all the files (and subdirectories) in the train/ directory.
